## List Tracks

```http
GET /tracks?limit=20&offset=0&q=Jatuh%20Suka
```

Returns a paginated list of tracks matching criteria. Supports ETag validation (returns `304 Not Modified` when `If-None-Match` header matches).

### Headers

- `x-api-key`: `<your_client_api_key>` (or `Authorization: Bearer <key>`)

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Constraints | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `limit` | integer | `100` | Min `1`, Max `100` | Max items per page |
| `offset` | integer | `0` | Min `0` | Number of items to skip |
| `q` | string | `null` | Optional | Case-insensitive title search query |

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
    "title": "Jatuh Suka",
    "slug": "jatuh-suka",
    "duration": 224,
    "album_id": "alb_9c4b2a",
    "album": {
      "title": "Manusia"
    },
    "artists": [
      {
        "id": "art_3d8e1f",
        "name": "Tulus"
      }
    ],
    "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_7f9a2b1c/playlist.m3u8",
    "images": {
      "small": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_small.webp",
      "medium": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_medium.webp",
      "large": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_large.webp",
      "original": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_original.webp"
    }
  }
]
```

