## Get Track Details

```http
GET /tracks/:id
```

Fetches complete metadata for a single track by ID.

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
  "title": "Jatuh Suka",
  "slug": "jatuh-suka",
  "duration": 224,
  "bitrate": 160,
  "format": "m4a",
  "source": "youtube",
  "provider_url": "https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=example_yt_id",
  "original_id": "yt_example_yt_id",
  "status": "ready",
  "created_at": "2024-03-15T10:30:00Z",
  "album": {
    "id": "alb_9c4b2a",
    "title": "Manusia",
    "slug": "manusia",
    "year": 2022
  },
  "artists": [
    {
      "id": "art_3d8e1f",
      "name": "Tulus",
      "slug": "tulus"
    }
  ],
  "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_7f9a2b1c/playlist.m3u8",
  "images": {
    "small": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_small.webp",
    "medium": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_medium.webp",
    "large": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_large.webp",
    "original": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_original.webp"
  }
}
```

