## Get Track Recommendations Algorithm

```http
GET /tracks/:id/recommendations?limit=20
```

Calculates recommended tracks matching the current track using category similarity weighting and popularity boosting.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Req["GET /tracks/:id/recommendations"] --> SharedCategory["1. Join track_categories to find shared categories"]
    SharedCategory --> Weight["2. Count shared_categories per candidate track"]
    Weight --> Sort["3. Sort by shared_categories DESC -> play_count DESC -> RANDOM()"]
    Sort --> CheckResults{"Found Matches?"}
    CheckResults -- Yes --> ReturnRecs["Return Ranked Recommendations"]
    CheckResults -- No --> FallbackPopular["Fallback: Top Tracks by play_count DESC + RANDOM()"]
```

### Recommendation Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Constraints | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `limit` | integer | `20` | Min `1`, Max `50` | Number of recommendations to return |

---

## Get Random Tracks

```http
GET /tracks/random?limit=10
```

Returns a daily seeded randomized selection of ready tracks for radio and discovery playlists.

---

## Count Ready Tracks

```http
GET /tracks/count
```

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "total": 1450
}
```

---

## Create Track (Master Only)

```http
POST /tracks
```

### Headers

- `X-Master-Key`: `<your_master_secret>`
- `Content-Type`: `application/json`

### Request Body

```json
{
  "title": "Hati-Hati di Jalan",
  "artist_id": "art_3d8e1f",
  "album_id": "alb_9c4b2a",
  "audio_url": "hls:trk_8e2b1a9c",
  "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_8e2b1a9c.webp",
  "duration": 242,
  "bitrate": 160,
  "format": "m4a",
  "original_id": "yt_d9f8a2b",
  "provider_url": "https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=d9f8a2b"
}
```

### Response (`201 Created`)

```json
{
  "id": "trk_8e2b1a9c",
  "status": "ready"
}
```

